Package: com.qqhelperport.tweak
Name: QQHelper Port (QQ 6.2)
Version: 0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Port of QQHelper features to QQ 6.2 on iOS 10. Restores the long-press Recall menu item and adds anti-revoke, avatar pendant hiding, weather removal and chat timestamp hiding. Each feature has its own kill switch in /tmp.
Maintainer: qqhp
Author: qqhp
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 7.0)
